{"scene_id": "s02461", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s02461.fountain", "heading": "INT. TATTOO PARLOR UNDER THE BRIDGE - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "CASIMIR VOSS-ADEYEMI", "names": ["CASIMIR VOSS-ADEYEMI", "CASIMIR"], "gender": "m", "first": 6, "spoke": 11}, {"id": 1, "name": "DASHIELL MORROW", "names": ["DASHIELL MORROW", "DASHIELL"], "gender": "m", "first": 8, "spoke": 11}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. TATTOO PARLOR UNDER THE BRIDGE - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Concrete overhead.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Traffic rolls above like distant surf, every pass shaking dust from the beams.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Fluorescent tubes buzz.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "The walls are papered in flash sheets: anchors, daggers, roses with blades through them.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "A reclining chair sits at the center like an altar, vinyl cracked, duct-taped.", "para": 0, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "CASIMIR VOSS-ADEYEMI, forty, bald, forearms sleeved in faded ink, sits on a rolling stool, loading a needle into a machine with the care of a surgeon.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "He does not look up when the door chimes.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "DASHIELL MORROW, thirty-five, lean, rain still beading on his leather jacket, steps inside and shuts the door behind him.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "He keeps one hand in his pocket.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "He takes in the room in a single slow pass: the chair, the cabinets, the back exit propped by a milk crate.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We're closed.", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The sign says open.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The sign lies.", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Dashiell crosses to the chair and rests his free hand on its headrest.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Casimir still has not looked at him.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm here about a piece.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't do walk-ins.", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's a custom job. Something a man gave me years ago, and he said you'd know the design.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Casimir finally lifts his eyes.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "They are pale, patient, flat.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Show me.", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "Dashiell removes his hand from his pocket.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "In his palm: a small brass key, worn smooth.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "He sets it on the tray beside the ink.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Casimir looks at it a long time.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Then he sets down the machine.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Where did you get that?", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "From the man who owed you.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He's dead.", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He was patient about it.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "The bridge rumbles.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Both men listen to a truck pass overhead, and the dust drifts onto the tray.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Casimir stands.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Dashiell does not step back.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "They are of a height, and the room seems to contract around them.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "He said the key opens a locker at the Union Station.", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It opens a locker.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And what's in it?", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Whatever you came to him for in ninety-eight.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Casimir's jaw tightens.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "His hand drifts toward a drawer.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Why?", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because he left instructions. If the drawer opens, so does a second envelope at a lawyer's office on Fifth.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Casimir's hand freezes.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Dashiell's eyes stay on it.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Neither man blinks.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "A single drop falls from the bridge above and strikes the tray, shivering the key.", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Slowly, Casimir withdraws his hand.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Dashiell lets out a breath.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "They both sit, mirror images, on stool and chair, the key glinting between them.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So what do you want?", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["quietly"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "A tattoo.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Of what?", "name": "CASIMIR", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "A locker number.", "name": "DASHIELL", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Casimir almost laughs.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Then he reaches for the needle.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}]}